      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "loonnet",
      "narration_text": "First receipt: LoonNet. One hundred six images to train on. Twenty-six held back, never seen. Two classes — common loon and not. Team Madison went frame by frame on the held-out set. Nineteen of twenty-six came back clean. The seven misses are not one bug. Double-counting is a merge setting. Reeds and fog are data. Pull both levers at once and you learn nothing about either.",
